    <string name="settings_fps_max">Frame rate limit</string>
    <string name="settings_fps_max_help">Caps frames per second. The phone heats up less and keeps its full processor speed longer: steadier than alternating between full speed and thermal throttling.</string>
    <string name="settings_screen_help">Largest resolution offered to the game: then pick it in the game\'s own graphics menu. Lower is much faster; the image is scaled to the screen.</string>
    <string name="settings_engine_unknown">not recognized</string>
    <string name="settings_turnip_sysmem">Direct rendering (Turnip)</string>
    <string name="settings_tso">Strict memory order (x86)</string>
    <string name="settings_tso_help">The game is translated again keeping the x86 order of memory accesses between threads. Needed by games whose threads share data without locks (Unreal Engine 3: Dishonored); slower.</string>
    <string name="settings_turnip_sysmem_help">DXVK games with Turnip: the GPU draws without tiles. Faster when the game makes thousands of draw calls per frame (Castlevania), sometimes slower otherwise.</string>
