    <string name="settings_ue_low_memory">Reduced memory profile</string>
    <string name="settings_ue_low_memory_help">No Lumen or virtual shadows, simpler meshes, textures and effects: much less graphics memory, flatter image. For phones with 8 GB or less.</string>
    <string name="settings_texture_reduce">Texture compression</string>
    <string name="settings_texture_reduce_help">Large textures that the game never streams (menus, maps, atlases) are created at half size in each direction: a quarter of the memory, slightly blurrier. On a phone the GPU uses the RAM: this frees about 200 MB in Clair Obscur at 2048 px.</string>
